passt (https://passt.top/passt) for HongMeng, applied by native/sandbox/install.sh to
commit 6aa4f88 and built inside the sandbox (ohm-sandbox build-pasta). The kernel has
no user namespaces (no /proc/self/uid_map), does not honour CLONE_FILES (a socket a
clone()d child opens never reaches the parent: the namespace calls run in a thread,
which shares the file table and whose setns() moves only itself), refuses
CLOSE_RANGE_UNSHARE (EOPNOTSUPP), and its tmpfs takes no size options.

